# FPS-FIELD-BARN-TURN-SR: FPS-FIELD-BARN-TURN under DLSS Super Resolution instead of the machine's Ray
# Reconstruction (UPSCALE-SR-120HZ, the recommended 120 Hz path on Turing / Ampere): the same view, still air and
# turn, so its GPU tables compare line by line with TURN's RR run. The method is set for this run only (an
# unattended run keeps the quality in session); machine.json stays byte-for-byte as it was.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/FIELD_Barn.desce --gpu-profile
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Anti-Aliasing "Anti-Aliasing: DLSS"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,0.03,-1
Дано set 8180000000000004 WindSourceData.Speed 0
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид t0_still the barn view still: field, barn, trees and sky drawn
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Spin 1
Когда frames 360
Когда profile-dump
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Spin 0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,0.03,-1
Когда frames 60
Тогда-вид t1_turn the barn view after a full turn: the same field, barn, trees and sky as t0_still
